<pre>

Guild info from March, 2002.

Name: The Guild of Channellers
Command: channellers
Creator: Shinarae
Maximum level: 30

Description:
Channellers are those to whom the manipulation of magical forces is more
instinctive than learned. They are masters of their domain, the directing of
magical energies from one source to another. Not only can they use their
powers in combat, but they can place magical powers into mundane items, and
even drain magical energy from other places into themselves.
At the dawning of this day, the leader was Baltzebub.

Joining requirements:
 Background must be magical or civilized (wrong or incomplete)
Abilities gained when joining:
 May study spell Darkness to 11%
 May study spell Light to 11%
 May study spell Energy aura to 11%
 May study spell See magic to 11%
 May train skill Attack to 7%
 May train skill Cast generic to 7%
 May train skill Essence eye to 15%
 May train skill Short blades to 7%
 May train skill Bludgeons to 7%
 May train skill Consider to 15%
 Receive the channeller guild insignia
 Receive the reward for your continued progress

